		(at 36 36)
		(descr "NeoPixel Ring 24 module, O65.5 OD / O52.3 ID / 3.2 thick -- the fitted part (#794). DOCUMENTATION ONLY: no pads. The module PIN-MOUNTS on J3 (ModuleMountPads_Ring24, re-cut for this ring at r=31.59 -- see MANUFACTURING.md); J2 (WirePads_1x04) remains as a flying-wire fallback. No 3D model: the Ring 16's NeoPixel_PCB.wrl is the wrong diameter and a wrongly-sized model is worse than none.")
